1-2026-kamera-360.webp\" alt=\"Kamera 360 derajat high-definition panoramic image BYD Atto 1 Premium\" width=\"711\" height=\"346\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>High-definition panoramic image (kamera 360)</strong> di tipe Premium. Tipe Standard dan Dynamic sudah dilengkapi kamera mundur.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-2026-spion-lipat-elektrik.webp\" alt=\"Spion lipat elektrik BYD Atto 1 Dynamic dan Premium\" width=\"1221\" height=\"818\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Spion lipat elektrik</strong> di tipe Dynamic dan Premium, praktis saat parkir di gang sempit.</figcaption></figure>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Semua tipe sudah dibekali ESC, ABS, EBD, traction control, Hill-Start Assist, Auto Hold, rem parkir elektrik, cruise control, dan ISOFIX. Dynamic menambah 3 sensor parkir belakang, TPMS, dan airbag tirai depan-belakang; Premium melengkapinya dengan airbag samping depan sehingga total 6 airbag.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5a7d00;font-weight:700\">Baterai & Pengisian Daya</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Hemat, Aman, dan Cepat Diisi</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-2026-e-platform-3.webp\" alt=\"e-Platform 3.0 BYD Atto 1\" width=\"466\" height=\"347\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>e-Platform 3.0</strong>, platform khusus mobil listrik BYD.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-2026-blade-battery.webp\" alt=\"BYD Blade Battery pada Atto 1\" width=\"464\" height=\"347\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>BYD Blade Battery</strong> 30,08 kWh (Standard & Dynamic) atau 38,88 kWh (Premium).</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-2026-fast-charging.webp\" alt=\"Pengisian daya cepat BYD Atto 1 hingga 40 kW\" width=\"463\" height=\"347\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Fast charging</strong> DC 30 kW (Standard & Dynamic) dan 40 kW (Premium). Di rumah, pengisian AC hingga 6,6 kW.</figcaption></figure>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Semua tipe punya fitur <strong>Vehicle-to-Load (V2L)</strong> untuk menyalakan peralatan listrik saat piknik atau mati lampu. Cek lokasi SPKLU di <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/charging-garansi-servis-byd-makassar/#peta\">peta charging Makassar</a> dan hitung biaya cas di <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/kalkulator-charging-byd/\">kalkulator charging BYD</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5a7d00;font-weight:700\">Kabin & Teknologi</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Kabin Modern, Fitur Lengkap</h2>\n<figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/upl